// 27-move roster. kind: melee | direct | super. slot: 1 = close-range active slot (melee smash, breath, cones),
// 2 = ranged/super active slot (blaster, beams, lobs, supers); default 1 for melee/cone, 2 otherwise (stomp is never slotted).
// rapid:true = quick particle/projectile weapon: no cooldown, fires on every press (config rapidProjectileCap on screen).
// unlock: {"type":"start"} | {"type":"buildings","count":N} | {"type":"landmark","landmark":"empress"}
//   | {"type":"milestone"} (config: roarUnlockLandmarks landmarks OR roarUnlockHits hits survived)
// chest:true = the unlock drops a LOCKED skill chest near the monster; open it with a store key (config keyCost).
// In Adventure, every chest skill not yet owned also drops (free to open) on level 5.
// kind super = fuelled by EATEN civilians (eat-to-fuel cost, config eatCost*), so supers have no cooldown.
// glow:true moves can hatch monster eggs. Numbers: radius/reach in metres, bricks = bricks per hit (per tick for
// continuous moves), cooldown seconds, impulse = knock strength.
